SUMMARY:Scenic AVL #6: Mount Royal Roller
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\nRating: Strenuous for Elevation Ga
 in\nDistance: 5 miles\nPace: 3.2 mph\nElevation Gain: 1000\, in the first 
 1.5 miles.\nSurface: Road\nDogs: On leash\nBears: Possible\nRoute: [Mt Roy
 al Roller](https://www.alltrails.com/explore/recording/evening-hike-1e9f65
 0-163?p=-1&sh=ifwm3x)\n\nScenic Asheville Series: There are 9 hikes in the
  series\; hike them all and receive an [attractive](https://docs.google.co
 m/drawings/d/1goXUXfzUBqhB4_UeCxodlk4ZPeCCgqZrWK2EUJvk_vI/edit?usp=drivesd
 k) badge for your backpack. Check your progress [HERE](https://docs.google
 .com/spreadsheets/d/1XUm-X1_OhxKIi8JU5rhjsW37cAl4yYx8yB_NEjjI5Lk/edit?usp=
 drivesdk).\n\nRSVP and On-Time Start:\n\n*If you decide you cannot come\, 
 please change your RSVP status to "Not Going" as soon as possible so wait-
 listers can have sufficient notice.\n\n**Guests:** If you bring a guest or
  plus one\, please make sure they are fit enough to make the climb 🪜 - 
 this is the most strenuous hike in the series.\n\nDisclaimer and Release o
 f Liability:\nThis activity involves hiking on city streets that may have 
 traffic. Participants are responsible for their safety on streets and trai
 ls. The organizer of this trip is a volunteer and not a professional guide
 . The function of the organizer is only to organize this trip. If you sign
  up or participate in this event you acknowledge that you freely and volun
 tarily agree to assume all risks of injuries\, illnesses\, and damages ari
 sing from\, as a result of\, and associated with this event. In addition\,
  you acknowledge that you agree to the Meetup terms: [https://www.meetup.c
 om/terms](https://www.meetup.com/terms)\nRead less
